WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
Outside the walls of ancient
Jerusalem lay a valley called Gehenna.

2
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:09.450
In the Gospels, Jesus uses its
name as a picture of punishment.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.760
Many Christians came to
read it as hell itself.

4
00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:16.040
The Book of Revelation paints
a very different scene:

5
00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:18.670
a new heaven and a new earth.

6
00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:21.160
So what are heaven and hell?

7
00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:22.330
Real places?

8
00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:24.710
Conditions of the soul after death?

9
00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:27.420
Or pictures of how people live now?

10
00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:31.660
In this mission, you'll look closely at
what the Bible's pictures of judgement,

11
00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:34.820
heaven, hell and purgatory might mean.

12
00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:39.130
Then you'll weigh up whether these
words are best understood as symbols.

13
00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:43.310
Your mission: find out what
kind of reality heaven might be.
